{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style></style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">히노끼 루바(유절)은 편백나무로 잘 알려져 있으며 일본에서</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">식재되는 상록 교목입니다. 물에 강해 사우나재로도 쓰이고 있으며,</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">피톤치드 발산량이 많아 특유의 향을 갖고 있는 것이 특징입니다.</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">나뭇결이 조밀하고 광택이 있으며, 고급바닥재나 창호 욕조로 쓰입니다.</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\"><strong><u>· 규격</u></strong></span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">10T x 100 x 2400 (8자)</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">유절 비압축은 별도 문의</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\"></span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\"><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"b49ed6d648773d3ebefc9a3524d2f929_173937.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/b49ed6d648773d3ebefc9a3524d2f929_173937.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"22ddafc2eaaa6b7d9ed39a22547d289a_173937.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/22ddafc2eaaa6b7d9ed39a22547d289a_173937.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"ad3b02ec0d82648284e583a10cb60f63_173938.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/ad3b02ec0d82648284e583a10cb60f63_173938.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"649e29cff4b04c9831ab547a4d1bdbc8_173938.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/649e29cff4b04c9831ab547a4d1bdbc8_173938.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"b266a3bba3721d4335f193504a6bff39_173940.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/b266a3bba3721d4335f193504a6bff39_173940.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /></span></p></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}